{
  "name": "enterprise-workloads",
  "description": "Realistic enterprise workloads over the synthetic Northwind Traders corpus (app.rag.evaluation.workloads) plus the Harborline golden corpus: discovery by filename, month, date and site; small fragmented documents; follow-ups and topic switches; Urdu and Roman Urdu; multi-document questions; grounding; ACLs; a large repetitive log.",
